<title>CANADA: Toronto-Dominion Bank Q4 net climbs 10 pct.</title>
<headline>Toronto-Dominion Bank Q4 net climbs 10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>fourth quarter ended Oct 31</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.79		   C$0.71</p>
<p> Net			249,000		  226,000</p>
<p> Assets	     125,644,000	    109,008,000</p>
<p> Deposits	    87,563,000	     81,131,000</p>
<p> Loans		 85,454,000	     72,658,000</p>
<p>			12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			 C$2.89		   C$2.48</p>
<p> Net			914,000		  794,000</p>
<p>	 (All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Above per share results fully diluted. Basic Q4 earnings were C$0.81 per share versus C$0.72 per share in Q4 1995.</p>
<p>For full year, basic earnings were C$2.95 a share in 1996 compared to C$2.51 per share in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
